I'm playing an exctinctionist, and I want to exctinct skeletons.
Since they are non-genocidable, non-randomly generated and stone
resistant, my only 3 means to exctinct them is by wishes, "oLS or
polymorphing unicorn horns+ivory rings. I'm going for poly, and after
reading some spoilers and source code, I figured the best is to create
large stacks of cursed bone items and poly them at luck -13. My doubt
was how large should those stacks be, so I wiztested a bit.
The setup was the following: for each test I had 206 cursed unihorns
and luck -13. I would
 - arrange them in stacks of size N and polymorph them;
 - from the polyed piles, recover bone items for future use;
 - poly the rest of the polypile to get more horns (bone);
 - repeat until all bone items are used.
I ended up doing 2 tests for each size N.
